---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<Base title="Ordering, payment and shipping">
  <div class="wrap prose" style="padding-bottom:72px">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span>Ordering, payment and shipping</nav>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem);font-weight:800">Ordering, payment and shipping</h1>
    <h2>Ordering</h2>
    <p>
      Prices on this site are current and in US dollars. Add parts to an order request, or email or call us with part numbers.
      We confirm every order, then send an invoice that includes the exact shipping cost. All orders are prepaid before we
      ship.
    </p>
    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Credit cards and PayPal invoicing.</li>
      <li>Orders placed from outside the US or Canada carry a 3% foreign transaction fee on goods plus shipping.</li>
      <li>Orders from outside North America can pay by wire transfer: 3% foreign transaction fee plus a $30 wire fee.</li>
      <li>American Express transactions carry an additional 1% on merchandise plus shipping.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Shipping</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Residential addresses and small businesses: trackable USPS Priority Mail.</li>
      <li>Large, complex, government or military facilities, or large or valuable orders: FedEx Ground unless you ask otherwise. Express is available.</li>
      <li>We can ship on your company's or a third party's FedEx account.</li>
      <li>Insurance is optional within the US and Canada; you assume responsibility for loss or damage if you decline it. Orders outside the US and Canada are insured unless you decline.</li>
      <li>We don't ship UPS or DHL unless you prepare the label and email it to us.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Language</h2>
    <p>
      We communicate in English and through Google Translate. Our emails include both our original English and the
      translation. We're not responsible for misinterpretation of translated text.
    </p>
    <p>Questions? Call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <p class="hint"><a href="/media/brand/policies-2020.pdf">Original policy notice (PDF)</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
